<%# locals: (f:, attribute:, subject:, aria:, data:) %>
<%#
  014 FR-005 — a password field together with the control that reveals it.

  One partial for both fields, so the button and its icons are described once;
  each render is its own password-visibility controller instance, and that is
  what makes the two fields independent of each other (FR-006). `subject` is
  what the control calls the field out loud — "Show password", "Show confirm
  password" — so the two are told apart by name and not by position.

  The icons are decorative and hidden from assistive technology: the button's
  aria-label is its accessible name, which is the pattern the locker editor's
  pencil already uses. Both are drawn, and CSS picks which one is on screen from
  the field's own type.

  025: both label strings are composed here, server-side, and handed to the
  controller as two whole values rather than a subject alone — the toggle used
  to build "Hide %{subject}" itself in JavaScript, with "Show"/"Hide" hardcoded
  in English, so clicking the control under French produced a mixed-language
  name ("Hide mot de passe"). JavaScript has no access to config/locales; only
  the server does.
%>
<div class="field-input-wrapper" data-controller="password-visibility"
     data-password-visibility-show-label-value="<%= t(".show", subject: subject) %>"
     data-password-visibility-hide-label-value="<%= t(".hide", subject: subject) %>">
  <%= f.password_field attribute, class: "field-input", autocomplete: "new-password",
        aria: aria, data: data.merge(password_visibility_target: "input") %>

  <button type="button" class="field-visibility-toggle"
          aria-label="<%= t(".show", subject: subject) %>"
          data-password-visibility-target="button"
          data-action="password-visibility#toggle">
    <svg class="field-visibility-icon-show" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24"
         fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"
         stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
      <path d="M1 12s4-8 11-8 11 8 11 8-4 8-11 8-11-8-11-8z"/>
      <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"/>
    </svg>

    <svg class="field-visibility-icon-hide" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24"
         fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"
         stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
      <path d="M17.94 17.94A10.07 10.07 0 0 1 12 20c-7 0-11-8-11-8a18.45 18.45 0 0 1 5.06-5.94M9.9 4.24A9.12 9.12 0 0 1 12 4c7 0 11 8 11 8a18.5 18.5 0 0 1-2.16 3.19m-6.72-1.07a3 3 0 1 1-4.24-4.24"/>
      <path d="m1 1 22 22"/>
    </svg>
  </button>
</div>
